1. Live2D Cubism SDK / runtime
   The bundled runtime at assets/vendor/l2d.min.js embeds the Live2D Cubism SDK
   (Cubism 2 and Cubism 6 runtimes). Use of the Cubism SDK is governed by the
   Live2D Proprietary Software License Agreement:
   https://www.live2d.com/eula/live2d-proprietary-software-license-agreement_en.html
   Commercial use may require a separate license from Live2D Inc.

2. l2d (https://github.com/hacxy/l2d) — MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023-PRESENT Hacxy
   Vendored as assets/vendor/l2d.min.js. Its LICENSE and README are kept alongside
   it as assets/vendor/l2d-LICENSE.txt and assets/vendor/l2d-README.md.

3. Live2D models under assets/models/
   Model assets (textures, .moc / .moc3, motions, physics) are the property of
   their original rights holders and were obtained from the public collection at
   https://github.com/Eikanya/Live2d-model. They are NOT covered by the MIT
   license above. Check each model's own terms before redistributing or using
   them commercially. The MIT license applies only to this plugin's own code.

   Per-character provenance, so any single character can be removed on request
   by deleting its directory and the matching entry in lib/index.js
   (BUILTIN_META):

     assets/models/sagiri/     Sagiri, from "Eromanga Sensei"
                               source: Live2D/纱雾live2d.zip
     assets/models/rem/        Rem, from "Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-"
                               source: Live2D/Live2dRem-master.zip
     assets/models/histoire/   Histoire, from "Hyperdimension Neptunia"
                               source: Live2D/Live2dHistoire-master.zip
     assets/models/tia/        Tia, a Live2D official sample model
                               source: Live2D/Live2D-master.zip

   None of these four ships with a licence granting redistribution. No takedown
   or removal request from a rights holder has been received; should one arrive,
   removing the named directory removes the asset from this package entirely.
